### LiveMunshi API Test Requests (PostgreSQL Schema)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}
@khataId = c97a6365-4ab4-4128-973e-19aa2671166f
@anilKcId = 3aab55ca-ada4-41d4-abbd-95977ba8e95c

### 1. Root & Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/

### 2. Health Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 3. Login with Mobile Number & 4-Digit PIN
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobile_number": "9876543210",
  "pin": "1234"
}

### 4. Refresh Access Token
# @name refreshToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 5. Forgot Password (Request OTP)
# @name forgotPassword
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobile_number": "9876543210"
}

### 6. Verify Reset Password OTP (Optional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobile_number": "9876543210",
  "otp_code": "123456"
}

### 7. Reset Password with OTP & New PIN
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobile_number": "9876543210",
  "otp_code": "123456",
  "new_pin": "1234"
}

### 8. Logout / Revoke Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 9. Send Generic OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobile_number": "9876543210",
  "purpose": "LOGIN"
}

### 5. Get User Profile & Khatas
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Get Khatas List
GET {{baseUrl}}/khatas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Get Khata Overview Stats (You Will Get / You Will Give)
GET {{baseUrl}}/khatas/{{khataId}}/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. List Customers in Khata (with live net balances)
GET {{baseUrl}}/parties/khata/{{khataId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Filter Customers by "LENE" (You Will Get)
GET {{baseUrl}}/parties/khata/{{khataId}}?filter=lene
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Filter Customers by "DENE" (You Will Give)
GET {{baseUrl}}/parties/khata/{{khataId}}?filter=dene
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Search Customer by Name
GET {{baseUrl}}/parties/khata/{{khataId}}?search=Suresh
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Create New Customer in Khata
POST {{baseUrl}}/parties/khata/{{khataId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Manish Gupta",
  "mobile_number": "9876543299",
  "address": "Main Market Road"
}

### 13. Get Customer Ledger Transactions & Running Balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/party/{{anilKcId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Add "LENE" Transaction (+ You Got ₹)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "khata_customer_id": "{{anilKcId}}",
  "amount": 2500.00,
  "transaction_type": "LENE",
  "description": "Online UPI payment received"
}

### 15. Add "DENE" Transaction (− You Gave ₹)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "khata_customer_id": "{{anilKcId}}",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "transaction_type": "DENE",
  "description": "Goods credit given"
}

### 16. Customer Statement (Print / PDF / WhatsApp format)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/party/{{anilKcId}}/statement
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Khata Summary Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/khata/{{khataId}}/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
